  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#flow-content-3 has this block:\n\n``` CSS\n/* for small devices, modal dialogs go full-screen */\n@media screen and (max-width: 540px) {\n  dialog:modal {\n    top: 0;\n    width: auto;\n    margin: 1em;\n  }\n}\n```\n\nIt seems odd for the spec to have a breakpoint for when this \"full-screen\" (not in the https://fullscreen.spec.whatwg.org sense) style should apply.\n\nBlink's [html.css](https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/90f43894e6b47e9dd5db985cb9fe29d41a4db963/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/css/html.css#1060) does not include this rule.\n",
